   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Bài 6",
     "texto": [
      "Topic: clothes, possessives, «why?», «for», «because», adjectives, colours and «very».",
      "In this part: **clothes, adjectives, colours, «của» and «very»**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Classifiers for clothes",
     "texto": [
      "Almost all garments use **cái**: **cái áo sơ mi** (a shirt), **cái váy** (a skirt).",
      "The belt uses **sợi** (thin, long things): **sợi dây nịt**.",
      "Shoes and socks: **chiếc** for a single one and **đôi** for the pair: **một đôi giày** = a pair of shoes.",
      "Tip: **áo** is everything from the waist up, and **quần** everything from the waist down."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Four verbs for «to wear»",
     "texto": [
      "In Vietnamese, the verb depends on the garment:",
      "• **mặc**: clothes (shirt, trousers, dress): **mặc áo**.",
      "• **đeo**: watch, jewellery, glasses: **đeo đồng hồ**.",
      "• **mang**: shoes and socks: **mang giày**.",
      "• **đội**: hats and caps: **đội mũ**.",
      "To take off anything: **cởi**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Colours",
     "texto": [
      "Colours are said with **màu** (colour) in front: **màu đỏ** = red.",
      "**xanh** means both green and blue. To tell them apart: **xanh lá cây** (like the leaves on a tree) = green, **xanh da trời** (like the skin of the sky) = blue.",
      "In conversation **màu** can be dropped: **áo sơ mi trắng** = white shirt."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
